	<section_number>17.1-324</section_number>
	<catch_line>Justices of Supreme Court</catch_line>
	<text>
		The justices of the Supreme Court shall receive such salaries as shall be fixed from time to time in the general appropriation act.
	</text>
	<history>Code 1950, § 14-38; 1964, c. 386, § 14.1-29; 1971, Ex. Sess., c. 156; 1972, c. 856; 1998, c. 872.</history>
